this purpose) and possibly to engrave something into the floor with a 
hard one (Elbereth).  But I'm not really an experienced player yet, so 
maybe I missed something about them!

However, to me only selling seems to be a really useful usage--but in 
this case I have to have them identified, simply *knowing* they are 
valuable is not enough, right?  And in recent games, I knew a couple of 
valuable/worthless gems by the time I left the Mines, but I rarely ever 
had them *identified* some time early in the game when I could have used 
the zorkmids well.

So what do you suggest about gems?  So far, I could not find any really 
useful thing to do with them other than ignoring them to not burden 
myself unnecessarily.  Is there something I haven't found out yet, or 
any suggestions on how to make good use of them?

